  "circulation": "Arrival gives immediate access to briefing, contracts, equipment and departure. Courtyard loop links every core service without a compulsory upstairs tour. Lodging/restoration/vault are bounded side branches; protected training is isolated from peaceful headquarters circulation.",
  "systems": "Facility districts have their own circuits, ventilation and acoustic transitions. Chapel, medical, workshop and relic storage remain different functions. Castle restoration may change decoration and service availability, never silently erase the only route or unlock a live hunt in the refuge.",
  "campaign": "Assignment office holds regional dossiers; archive records discoveries; armory owns gear; infirmary supports recovery; lodging supports future hired allies; workshop/research/restoration support later services. Research and companion behavior, purchases, persistence and hiring remain separate unimplemented systems.",
  "refine": [
    "This is an expansion reservation for the existing hub, not a claim that the current CastleHub geometry matches these coordinates. Preserve working stations when integrating.",
    "Split chemistry work from relic containment and occupied accommodation with real construction; review source references before building.",
    "Upper restoration at +6.5 m needs a reserved connecting stair tower, real return flights and clear gallery bearings; no invented room teleport.",
    "Train three protocols in physically separated bays with real reset/egress controls; training should grant no free campaign rewards."
  ],
